docs {
  Guard rails - so is the analysis index

  400 as well, and the message points at POST /_nl/analyze?force=true, which is the supported way to have it rebuilt.

  Both of the plugin's own indices are hidden system indices, so the model is never shown them; this guard is for when you name one yourself.
}
